SCOPE: A generalized unboarding agent, welcomes the customer,  based on form filled (name, what they want to buy, etc) it get information. It can take text and voice.


capability: elicit/get info from customer, writes info/response in a DB tied to that customer, at the end of inyeraction is a structured intake form of the customer that has the name, phone no. email etc (what the person wants to buy)


Goal:  
design, build and deploy(if necessary) a generalized agent (LLM with the following if necessary :knowledge base, tools etc)  that takes in information based on a form needed to be filled (that it knows I need to fill this form, I need to get this information from the customer). The agent should be able to be used for different businesses.

objectives:
welcome
get name
get email
get phone no.
get what customer want to do
write all to a database




